<title>BELGIUM: Santer says Renault did not follow spirit of law.</title>
<headline>Santer says Renault did not follow spirit of law.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Commission President Jaques Santer said on Wednesday that French car maker Renault SA had not followed the spirit of EU laws in how it went about closing a plant in Belgium.</p>
<p>&quot;Mr Santer regrets the way in which Renault have managed the closure,&quot; said his spokesman, Nikolaus van der Pas.</p>
<p>&quot;The spirit of the law was not respected.&quot;</p>
</text>
